#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:22
msgid "Project Metadata"
msgstr "Metadáta projektu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:24
msgid ""
"This tab stores metadata about your project. By default, there are fields "
"for **Title**, **Author**, **Copyright** and **Year**. You can add as many "
"other fields as you need."
msgstr ""
"Táto karta ukladá metadáta o vašom projekte. V predvolenom nastavení sú tu "
"polia pre **Názov**, **Autor**, **Autorské práva** a **Rok**. Môžete pridať "
"toľko ďalších polí, koľko potrebujete."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:33
msgid "The Project Settings Metadata dialog window"
msgstr "Dialógové okno metadát nastavení projektu"

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:35
msgid "Double-click an existing field to enter text."
msgstr "Dvakrát kliknite na existujúce pole na zadanie textu."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:37
msgid ""
"|list-add|\\ :guilabel:`Add field`: Adds a new field. In the dialog box "
"enter the name of the field."
msgstr ""
"|list-add|\\ :guilabel:`Pridať pole`: Pridá nové pole. V dialógovom okne "
"zadajte názov poľa."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:39
msgid ""
"|list-remove|\\ :guilabel:`Remove field`: Removes the selected field. You "
"can remove the default fields."
msgstr ""
"|list-remove|\\ :guilabel:`Odstrániť pole`: Odstráni vybrané pole. Môžete "
"odstrániť aj predvolené polia."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:43
msgid ""
"The data set up here will be written to the rendered files if :guilabel:"
"`Export metadata` is checked in :doc:`/exporting/render` dialog window "
"under :guilabel:`More Options`."
msgstr ""
"Dáta nastavené tu sa zapíšu do renderovaných súborov, ak je v dialógovom "
"okne :doc:`/exporting/render` zaškrtnuté :guilabel:`Exportovať metadáta` v "
"časti :guilabel:`Viac možností`."

#: ../../project_and_asset_management/project_settings/tab_meta_data.rst:45
msgid ""
"You can check the metadata in the rendered video by entering this in a "
"terminal window:"
msgstr ""
"Metadáta v renderovanom videu môžete skontrolovať zadaním nasledujúceho "
"príkazu v okne terminálu:"
